### jaehoon으로 로그인 - 수업 백엔드
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### 구독한 글쓴이의 리뷰 - yuna와 sujin
GET http://localhost:4001/api/reviews/subscribed

### taeyang 구독
PUT http://localhost:4001/api/users/taeyang/subscribers/me

### taeyang의 리뷰도 들어온다
GET http://localhost:4001/api/reviews/subscribed

### sujin 구독 취소
DELETE http://localhost:4001/api/users/sujin/subscribers/me

### yuna 구독 취소
DELETE http://localhost:4001/api/users/yuna/subscribers/me

### taeyang 구독 취소
DELETE http://localhost:4001/api/users/taeyang/subscribers/me

### 구독한 사람이 없다
GET http://localhost:4001/api/reviews/subscribed

### jisoo 구독 - 리뷰에 단 답변만 있는 사람
PUT http://localhost:4001/api/users/jisoo/subscribers/me

### 답변은 리뷰가 아니다
GET http://localhost:4001/api/reviews/subscribed
